# job-search environment index
#
# This file lists where configuration lives. It is not a secret store.
# Copy the project example you need and fill it in locally. Do not commit
# the filled copy (.env, .env.local, and .dev.vars are gitignored).

# Job Copilot — scanners, eval runners, and optional plugins
# (Gemini, OpenRouter, OpenAI-compatible, Anthropic, Apify, Notion, Gmail).
# Copy to projects/job-copilot/.env
# See: projects/job-copilot/.env.example

# Resume Matcher web app — API base URL for local Vite.
# Copy to projects/resume-matcher/apps/web/.env
# See: projects/resume-matcher/apps/web/.env.example

# Resume Matcher Worker — provider key for /api/tailor.
# Copy to projects/resume-matcher/apps/worker/.dev.vars
# See: projects/resume-matcher/apps/worker/.dev.vars.example

# There is no root .env. Phase 1 does not share one environment across projects.
